  "title": "PodcastOne (Nasdaq: PODC) Reports Record First Quarter 2027 Revenue of $16.1M; Adjusted EBITDA* of $1.6M (up 172% YoY)",
  "summary": "LOS ANGELES, Aug. 12, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - PodcastOne (Nasdaq: PODC ), a leading publisher and podcast sales network, today announced its record financial results for the first fiscal quarter (“Q1 Fiscal 2027”) ended June 30, 2026 of its fiscal year ending March 31, 2027 (“Fiscal 2027”). PodcastOne will host a conference call and webcast today, August 12, 2026, at 12:30 PM Eastern Time. Q1 Financial Operational Highlights Revenue increased 8% YoY to record $16.1 million Adjusted EBITDA*",
